<header class="coherence-pretext">
  <p class="coherence-kicker">jaredfoy.com / coherence / engineer</p>
  <h1>The Coherence Sphere</h1>
  <p class="coherence-subtitle">A tour for engineers</p>
  <p class="coherence-lede">Before the metaphysics, before the method, before the thesis &mdash; four artifacts the corpus has built. Things that compile, pass tests, run on real hardware. The amber constellation traces the path. Scroll to walk it.</p>
  <nav class="coherence-routes" aria-label="Choose a route through the corpus">
